default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-07T18:09:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T19:37:40Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T19:27:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"spam","draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123282","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123282.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123282.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nFixes touch input becoming unresponsive after selecting an item from an OptionButton in Web exports when \"Emulate Mouse From Touch\" is disabled.\r\n\r\nPopupMenu only handled mouse button events for item hit testing. Direct InputEventScreenTouch events were ignored, leaving the popup interaction in an incorrect state and preventing subsequent touch events from being processed.\r\n\r\nThis change handles screen-touch press and release events using the existing popup hit-testing logic.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nTested with a custom Web debug template using the minimal reproduction project:\r\n\r\n- Windows\r\n- Chrome\r\n- Web export\r\n- \"Emulate Mouse From Touch\" disabled\r\n- Selected an OptionButton item, then interacted with other controls\r\n- Confirmed subsequent touch input continued to work\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}